DO NOT COMMIT PRIVATE KEYS.

This repository must not contain a real TLS private key.
Generate a local development certificate/key pair outside the repository
(for example with mkcert) and configure the application to load it from
local-only paths via MERIDIAN_SSL_KEY and MERIDIAN_SSL_CERT, or use a
secrets manager.

The previously committed key material must also be removed from git history
and rotated if it may have been exposed.
